  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The use hereby permitted for body shop (B2) and car-spraying (B2) purposes shall not be carried on outside the following times 7am - 7pm, Monday to Friday and 7am to 6pm on Saturdays only.",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the use hereby approved begins, details of the proposed extraction and filtration equipment shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Details should include a technical specification of the extractor flue and elevations indicating its position on the building.",
    "Condition : 5 - The minimum spray booth extract vent height shall be 3 metres above roof height of any building, within a distance of five times the vent height and should not be less than 8m above ground level.",
    "Condition : 7 - All paint spray processes, including the application of primers and topcoats, shall only be carried out within a paint spray booth, fitted with extraction and filtration equipment.",
    "Condition : 8 - Emissions from all extract outlets shall not cause odour outside the site boundary."
  ],
